      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It would be greatly appreciated if we could be provided with example avatar IDs, so we can take a closer look.\n\nHOWEVER, it is expected that large system changes (like the audio changes in 2019.2.5) may deprecate some older components (like ONSP) and avatars that use these older components may no longer work properly. As we upgrade old technology to fix bugs, get new features, or refine present features, this sort of situation will occur.\n\nIn these cases, reuploading the content to use the updated/non-deprecated component will fix the issue.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
